# Changelog

## [1.0.0] - 2025-12-29
### Added
- Initial release of Eagle Eye – AI-Powered Face Hunter
- Manual and batch search capabilities
- AI-powered detection & recognition (YOLO, MTCNN, InsightFace)
- Real-time CCTV scanning and geo-location mapping
- Alert system with notifications and saved evidence
- Camera network management
- Database logging and reporting
- Interactive map generation
